{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975700/extras/399e63d683d4e368d17d9cbbc79c29c3.avif?t=1765389848\" width=1500 height=618 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as two ambitious workers at the controls of a locomotive, tasked with repairing a GIANT robot from the inside.\u00a0Using sophisticated tools and brainpower, solve <strong>puzzles </strong>with your <strong>Train</strong>! (and maybe uncover an industry-level conspiracy\u2026)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975700/extras/e11a0dac302b7910e5e34f270b3debb1.poster.avif?t=1765389848\" width=348 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975700/extras/e11a0dac302b7910e5e34f270b3debb1.webm?t=1765389848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975700/extras/e11a0dac302b7910e5e34f270b3debb1.mp4?t=1765389848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entirety of HeartFix Express' world will be explored using your trusty locomotive. Repair your way through the complex and understand what has happened to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOVE AROUND\u202f:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPEED UP </strong>and <strong>BRAKE</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TILT </strong>to take junctions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JUMP</strong> (from a rail to another)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INTERACT\u202f:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHISTLE </strong>to play wind instruments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY</strong> with your environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ACTIVATE </strong>mechanisms</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're a collective of 3 game developers, working full time on our game <strong>HeartFix Express</strong>. We all have first hand industry experience, but chose to go indie in the midst of the current crisis. <strong>HeartFix Express</strong> is our first game as <strong>Keur Collectif</strong>, and we hope it will enable us to make more games in the future !</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975700?t=1765389848","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975700?t=1765389848","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975700/4079bc8c1796a2cff182221e3f5c1f9aa229756f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765389848","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975700/4079bc8c1796a2cff182221e3f5c1f9aa229756f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765389848","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3983290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975700/extras/399e63d683d4e368d17d9cbbc79c29c3.avif?t=1765389848\" width=1500 height=618 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as two ambitious workers at the controls of a locomotive, tasked with repairing a GIANT robot from the inside.\u00a0Using sophisticated tools and brainpower, solve <strong>puzzles </strong>with your <strong>Train</strong>! (and maybe uncover an industry-level conspiracy\u2026)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975700/extras/e11a0dac302b7910e5e34f270b3debb1.poster.avif?t=1765389848\" width=348 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975700/extras/e11a0dac302b7910e5e34f270b3debb1.webm?t=1765389848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975700/extras/e11a0dac302b7910e5e34f270b3debb1.mp4?t=1765389848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entirety of HeartFix Express' world will be explored using your trusty locomotive. Repair your way through the complex and understand what has happened to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOVE AROUND\u202f:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPEED UP </strong>and <strong>BRAKE</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TILT </strong>to take junctions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JUMP</strong> (from a rail to another)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INTERACT\u202f:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHISTLE </strong>to play wind instruments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLAY</strong> with your environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ACTIVATE </strong>mechanisms</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're a collective of 3 game developers, working full time on our game <strong>HeartFix Express</strong>. We all have first hand industry experience, but chose to go indie in the midst of the current crisis. <strong>HeartFix Express</strong> is our first game as <strong>Keur Collectif</strong>, and we hope it will enable us to make more games in the future !</p>","developers":["Keur Collectif"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975700/362971bd3c2166c3e76c6b6e27abfcb06a2af3d6/header.jpg?t=1765389848","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3975700/1964600965/1fe7955ff9f3362c93d802bd3719656d4a6da53e/1756028240/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756561139","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3975700/1964600965/1fe7955ff9f3362c93d802bd3719656d4a6da53e/1756028240/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756561139","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3975700/1964600965/1fe7955ff9f3362c93d802bd3719656d4a6da53e/1756028240/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756561139","id":257187883,"name":"Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257187883/da2305043e6d07fd8f55f24ca472654ff8801586/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756561139"}],"name":"HeartFix Express","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-7600K CPU @ 3.80GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul